000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TDAYOFWK.
000400 AUTHOR.              BK DISMUKES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        4/26/93.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - NAPANEE.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
      ****************************************************************
      *                     T D A Y O F W K                          *
      *                                                              *
      *  THIS PROGRAM IS CALLED FROM                               . *
      *  IT ALLOWS THE USER TO FIND THE DAY OF THE WEEK GIVEN A      *
      *  DATE.                                                       *
      *                                                              *
      ****************************************************************

001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDAYOFWK-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                    ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

001700
001800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC              PIC X(1500).

001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

002500*----- VARIABLES USED TO VALIDATE THE DATES
002500 01  CURRENT-DATE.
002500     05  CUR-YY               PIC 9(2).
002500     05  CUR-MM               PIC 9(2).
002500     05  CUR-DD               PIC 9(2).
002500
      *----  VARIABLES TO CALL CJULIAN
       01  JULIAN-DDD                    PIC 9(3) VALUE ZEROS.
       01  YEAR                          PIC 9(4).
       01  BUILD-YEAR.
           05  BUILD-CC                  PIC 9(2).
           05  BUILD-YY                  PIC 9(2).

      *-----   VARIABLES TO CALL CDAYOFWK
      *    DE-YEAR                       PIC 9(4)
      *    JULIAN-DDD                    PIC 9(3)
       01  RETURN-DOW                    PIC X(2).


002500
002500
003200**************************************************************
003300**                                                          **
003400**                S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S           **
003500**                                                          **
003600**************************************************************

004100 COPY BUPARMS    IN COPYLIB.

004100 COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.

004100 COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYLIB.

004100 COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.


016300**************************************************************
016400**                                                          **
016500**                  S C R E E N   D A T A                   **
016600**                                                          **
016700**************************************************************


016900 01  SCREEN-DATA.
023100     05  DE-YEAR                                PIC X(2).
023100     05  DE-MONTH                               PIC X(2).
023100     05  DE-DAY                                 PIC X(2).
023100     05  DE-DOW                                 PIC X(9).



023200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.

024400 1-HSK.
           OPEN   I-O     DISPLAY-FILE.

           ACCEPT CURRENT-DATE FROM DATE.

024600     MOVE "TESTDOW"                TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
024600     MOVE SPACES                   TO   SCREEN-DATA.

028900     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE          DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

      *2-BLOWUP.
       COPY BLOWUP IN COPYLIB.


      ******************************************************************
      **                                                              **
      **                      M A I N   M E N U                       **
      **                                                              **
      ******************************************************************
       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "FDAYOFWK"     TO   VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SCREEN-DATA    TO   DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC        TO SCREEN-DATA.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO   2-EOJ.

           IF DE-YEAR IS ALPHABETIC
               MOVE CUR-YY    TO DE-YEAR.

           IF DE-YEAR < 80
               MOVE 20    TO BUILD-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 19    TO BUILD-CC.

           MOVE DE-YEAR      TO BUILD-YY.
           MOVE BUILD-YEAR   TO YEAR.

           IF DE-MONTH IS ALPHABETIC
               MOVE CUR-MM    TO DE-MONTH.

           IF DE-DAY IS ALPHABETIC
               MOVE CUR-DD    TO DE-DAY.

           MOVE ZEROS   TO JULIAN-DDD.
           CALL "CJULIAN"  USING YEAR, DE-MONTH, DE-DAY, JULIAN-DDD.
           CALL "CDAYOFWK"  USING YEAR, JULIAN-DDD, RETURN-DOW.
           EVALUATE RETURN-DOW
               WHEN "SU"
                   MOVE "SUNDAY"   TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "MO"
                   MOVE "MONDAY"   TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "TU"
                   MOVE "TUESDAY"  TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "WE"
                   MOVE "WEDNESDAY" TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "TH"
                   MOVE "THURSDAY" TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "FR"
                   MOVE "FRIDAY"   TO DE-DOW
               WHEN "SA"
                   MOVE "SATURDAY" TO DE-DOW
           END-EVALUATE.

           GO TO  6-MAIN.

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.


       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.


